message: "If you use Vi-Harness in your research or software engineering projects, please cite it as below."
title: "Vi-Harness: Enterprise-Grade, Model-Agnostic Coding-Agent Runtime and Harness"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-14
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vfcarida/Vi-Harness"
keywords:
  - "coding agents"
  - "agent harness"
  - "state machine"
  - "meta-harness"
  - "context engineering"
  - "prompt caching"
  - "software engineering"
abstract: >-
  Vi-Harness is an enterprise-grade, model-agnostic agent harness designed to investigate
  how much coding-agent performance derives from foundation models versus harness architecture,
  context compilation, progressive compaction, verification gating, and state-machine control.
